<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping - Cochin cargoes - Feb 12.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping - Cochin cargoes - Feb 12.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Cochin port on February 12:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons	    Ship		    Berthing</p>
<p>		     (LDD/ULD)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Crude		64,700 (ULD)     Vivekananda	    11/02</p>
<p>Fuel Oil	   10,000 (LDD)     Jag Pragati	    10/02</p>
<p>Sulphur	     5,000 (ULD)     Normar Pilot	   10/02</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Note:</p>
<p>LDD - Loading</p>
<p>ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Cochin)</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
